{"version":1,"content":"<p>胡定欣、陳敏之及其兒子雷子樂，今天（20日）出席起步禮，為一眾跑手打氣。</p><p>胡定欣透露平日如果老公有時間的話，會一齊練跑，她說：「有人帶領著或陪跑的話，當跑到腳痠痠、想停的時候，身邊有人能夠打氣，講一句『堅持住』，感覺又可以再跑。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.328045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:17:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:34:04.171646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"6c2b9d1d92c18e126b7d7b617539e35cf0a4231c506d3e26f381296660c82fbd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}